1
00:00:09,277 --> 00:00:11,927
=The Glory Fades 2=

2
00:00:11,927 --> 00:00:13,798
=Episode 8=

3
00:00:13,798 --> 00:00:14,798
(Sea Breeze Prison)

4
00:00:23,448 --> 00:00:24,448
Mr. Tu,

5
00:00:25,247 --> 00:00:26,247
something's wrong.

6
00:00:26,927 --> 00:00:28,368
Why is everyone staring at you?

7
00:00:33,008 --> 00:00:34,927
Shui, go back first.

8
00:00:35,322 --> 00:00:37,848
Mr. Tu, there are too many of them.
Let's go.

9
00:00:37,848 --> 00:00:38,848
Go back.

10
00:00:50,928 --> 00:00:51,928
Guys,

11
00:00:52,688 --> 00:00:53,688
he's the one

12
00:00:54,207 --> 00:00:56,008
who cut the supply line.

13
00:00:56,688 --> 00:00:58,207
Now none of us

14
00:00:58,688 --> 00:00:59,888
have anything to smoke!

15
00:00:59,928 --> 00:01:03,248
- Kill him!
- Kill him!

16
00:01:03,281 --> 00:01:05,167
You moron, how are we supposed to live?

17
00:01:05,536 --> 00:01:06,928
Beat him down!

18
00:01:06,968 --> 00:01:09,688
- Beat him!
- Beat him! Beat him!

19
00:01:09,688 --> 00:01:10,727
Phachai sold cigarettes

20
00:01:11,968 --> 00:01:13,847
to you at ten times the price.

21
00:01:14,088 --> 00:01:15,688
He even sold half a pack as a full one.

22
00:01:15,688 --> 00:01:16,767
Haven't you had enough?

23
00:01:17,847 --> 00:01:18,847
Is that true?

24
00:01:18,968 --> 00:01:19,968
Really?

25
00:01:20,448 --> 00:01:21,968
Half a pack as a full one?

26
00:01:22,728 --> 00:01:23,767
Don't listen to his crap!

27
00:01:24,528 --> 00:01:25,608
He's a liar!

28
00:01:26,287 --> 00:01:27,567
Boss Phachai said

29
00:01:27,927 --> 00:01:29,847
if we take him out today,

30
00:01:30,287 --> 00:01:31,287
the goods will come in.

31
00:01:31,728 --> 00:01:32,728
And from now on,

32
00:01:33,328 --> 00:01:35,168
your cigarette costs

33
00:01:35,927 --> 00:01:36,927
will be cut in half.

34
00:01:37,007 --> 00:01:40,287
Great!

35
00:01:40,808 --> 00:01:41,808
Stop!

36
00:01:46,808 --> 00:01:47,808
What are you doing?

37
00:01:51,847 --> 00:01:52,847
Sangkun,

38
00:01:53,407 --> 00:01:55,168
mobbing a fellow inmate,

39
00:01:55,328 --> 00:01:56,847
how many more years do you want?

40
00:01:58,048 --> 00:01:59,048
Captain Xia,

41
00:01:59,808 --> 00:02:01,968
he cut off our cigarette supply

42
00:02:02,248 --> 00:02:05,088
and gave us no way out.
Isn't that right?

43
00:02:05,088 --> 00:02:06,968
- Yeah!
- That's right!

44
00:02:07,448 --> 00:02:08,968
So you're beating him to death?

45
00:02:09,328 --> 00:02:12,127
You don't make the rules in Sea Breeze!

46
00:02:12,127 --> 00:02:13,127
Captain Xia!

47
00:02:14,248 --> 00:02:16,647
Why do you always protect him?

48
00:02:17,087 --> 00:02:18,767
Are you two sleeping together?

49
00:02:18,927 --> 00:02:20,168
It's not fair!

50
00:02:20,207 --> 00:02:21,608
Not fair!

51
00:02:26,087 --> 00:02:27,288
Disperse, all of you!

52
00:02:28,568 --> 00:02:29,807
Captain Xia,

53
00:02:30,087 --> 00:02:31,328
if you must protect him,

54
00:02:31,328 --> 00:02:32,367
we can't stop you.

55
00:02:32,487 --> 00:02:34,008
But what about our cigarettes?

56
00:02:34,008 --> 00:02:35,888
Yeah, what about our cigarettes?

57
00:02:37,168 --> 00:02:38,168
Wait here.

58
00:02:44,087 --> 00:02:46,927
These were all seized
from Phachai's cell.

59
00:02:47,048 --> 00:02:48,767
He hoarded so much all for himself,

60
00:02:49,367 --> 00:02:51,247
while you didn't even get a shred.

61
00:02:51,249 --> 00:02:52,336
How is there so much?

62
00:02:53,020 --> 00:02:54,647
- He took all of them!
- We had nothing!

63
00:02:54,647 --> 00:02:56,328
Line up, and everyone gets a share.

64
00:02:56,647 --> 00:02:57,767
Anyone who causes trouble...

65
00:03:01,249 --> 00:03:02,280
Don't shove!

66
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:03,291
We've got cigarettes!

67
00:03:05,728 --> 00:03:06,728
Tang,

68
00:03:07,367 --> 00:03:08,767
has Xia Yuyan lost her mind?

69
00:03:09,487 --> 00:03:10,487
If this continues,

70
00:03:10,728 --> 00:03:11,728
Sea Breeze Prison

71
00:03:12,128 --> 00:03:13,128
will soon belong to her

72
00:03:13,408 --> 00:03:14,408
and Tu Jiasheng.

73
00:03:19,008 --> 00:03:20,207
You lost again.

74
00:03:20,927 --> 00:03:23,767
Even your secret stash was uncovered.

75
00:03:24,168 --> 00:03:25,487
What else can you do?

76
00:03:25,967 --> 00:03:27,087
Since the guys inside

77
00:03:27,448 --> 00:03:28,487
can't take him down,

78
00:03:29,728 --> 00:03:30,728
don't blame me for this.

79
00:03:31,608 --> 00:03:32,608
Let me use your phone.

80
00:03:38,207 --> 00:03:40,128
Boss Huang, it's Phachai.

81
00:03:40,408 --> 00:03:41,568
Tu Jiasheng,

82
00:03:41,687 --> 00:03:42,687
your brother's enemy,

83
00:03:42,767 --> 00:03:43,967
is in Sea Breeze Prison now,

84
00:03:44,288 --> 00:03:45,408
living quite the high life.

85
00:03:45,807 --> 00:03:47,008
I can't stand the sight of it.

86
00:03:47,807 --> 00:03:48,807
Are you interested

87
00:03:49,288 --> 00:03:50,848
in sending someone to take care of him?

88
00:03:52,048 --> 00:03:53,048
I can help on my end.

89
00:03:53,568 --> 00:03:54,568
Warden Tang

90
00:03:54,647 --> 00:03:55,807
will look the other way.

91
00:04:01,448 --> 00:04:02,448
Thank you.

92
00:04:02,448 --> 00:04:03,448
You helped me out again.

93
00:04:03,527 --> 00:04:04,927
You missed out on that fight.

94
00:04:05,247 --> 00:04:07,008
Are your knuckles itching for action?

95
00:04:11,008 --> 00:04:12,008
Captain Xia,

96
00:04:12,728 --> 00:04:13,728
I want to see Tang Zhen.

97
00:04:16,087 --> 00:04:17,087
I told you,

98
00:04:17,087 --> 00:04:18,367
he won't work with you.

99
00:04:19,048 --> 00:04:20,408
Business is business.

100
00:04:21,008 --> 00:04:23,008
How will we know if we don't talk?

101
00:04:30,007 --> 00:04:31,007
Tu Jiasheng,

102
00:04:31,288 --> 00:04:32,608
don't get too smug.

103
00:04:48,367 --> 00:04:49,367
Warden,

104
00:04:49,408 --> 00:04:50,408
Tu Jiasheng is here.

105
00:04:51,088 --> 00:04:52,088
Captain Xia,

106
00:04:52,088 --> 00:04:54,007
I'd like to speak
with Warden Tang in private.

107
00:05:05,168 --> 00:05:06,168
Warden Tang,

108
00:05:06,288 --> 00:05:07,288
we finally meet.

109
00:05:07,288 --> 00:05:08,608
Sorry for all the trouble lately.

110
00:05:11,127 --> 00:05:12,127
Cut to the chase.

111
00:05:12,447 --> 00:05:13,447
What do you want?

112
00:05:14,648 --> 00:05:15,968
The business in Sea Breeze

113
00:05:16,528 --> 00:05:17,528
needs to change hands.

114
00:05:17,807 --> 00:05:18,848
Phachai is finished.

115
00:05:19,288 --> 00:05:20,288
I can take over.

116
00:05:20,408 --> 00:05:22,648
Cigarettes, booze,
and all the other stuff.

117
00:05:22,927 --> 00:05:25,528
Whatever you want,
I can bring it into Sea Breeze.

118
00:05:25,648 --> 00:05:27,007
Whatever Phachai paid you monthly,

119
00:05:27,567 --> 00:05:28,567
I'll double it.

120
00:05:29,288 --> 00:05:30,288
Tu Jiasheng,

121
00:05:31,168 --> 00:05:33,127
Sea Breeze belongs to the Nies,
and so do I.

122
00:05:33,968 --> 00:05:35,247
Why should I do business

123
00:05:35,247 --> 00:05:37,408
with you, an enemy of the Nie family?

124
00:05:40,807 --> 00:05:41,807
Warden Tang,

125
00:05:42,048 --> 00:05:43,768
you've spent your whole life
at Sea Breeze.

126
00:05:44,048 --> 00:05:45,247
Are you really content

127
00:05:45,968 --> 00:05:47,007
stuck here forever?

128
00:05:48,367 --> 00:05:50,168
Not only can I make you money,

129
00:05:50,687 --> 00:05:52,968
but I can also help you move up.

130
00:05:53,807 --> 00:05:55,327
What a warden can accomplish

131
00:05:55,528 --> 00:05:57,648
is far more than you think.

132
00:06:00,447 --> 00:06:01,927
You sure can talk a good game.

133
00:06:02,608 --> 00:06:03,728
My offer is on the table.

134
00:06:04,127 --> 00:06:05,127
Take your time.

135
00:06:06,327 --> 00:06:07,327
No rush.

136
00:06:10,288 --> 00:06:12,848
You'd better survive
the next few days first.

137
00:06:21,408 --> 00:06:22,567
How did the talk go?

138
00:06:23,367 --> 00:06:25,088
You won't need
to take me to him anymore.

139
00:06:25,447 --> 00:06:27,288
- What do you mean?
- He'll come to me.

140
00:06:42,972 --> 00:06:45,473
(Sea Breeze Prison)

141
00:07:00,327 --> 00:07:01,327
Let me.

142
00:07:13,887 --> 00:07:16,728
The last riot caused severe damage
to Blocks A and C.

143
00:07:16,968 --> 00:07:18,648
The repair list has been organized.

144
00:07:19,048 --> 00:07:20,048
Please take a look.

145
00:07:23,339 --> 00:07:24,760
(Warden Signature)

146
00:07:28,528 --> 00:07:29,648
I'll head out now.

147
00:07:29,848 --> 00:07:31,367
Two new inmates arrived today.

148
00:07:31,447 --> 00:07:32,447
I'll go check on them.

149
00:07:33,048 --> 00:07:34,048
Captain Xia,

150
00:07:34,447 --> 00:07:37,208
leave the grunt work
to the guards below.

151
00:07:37,648 --> 00:07:38,648
Sit.

152
00:07:40,608 --> 00:07:41,608
Sit down.

153
00:07:46,927 --> 00:07:48,968
You've been getting close
with Tu Jiasheng.

154
00:07:49,567 --> 00:07:51,807
Warden, you told me
to watch him yourself.

155
00:07:51,968 --> 00:07:53,408
I told you to watch him,

156
00:07:54,247 --> 00:07:55,447
not to protect him.

157
00:07:55,487 --> 00:07:57,048
He behaves, so I won't touch him.

158
00:07:57,208 --> 00:07:59,487
And if he doesn't, I'll deal with him.

159
00:07:59,848 --> 00:08:01,088
Have you read his file?

160
00:08:01,367 --> 00:08:02,367
Tu Jiasheng,

161
00:08:02,408 --> 00:08:03,927
the owner of Prosperity,
was charged with

162
00:08:04,168 --> 00:08:05,168
running prostitution,

163
00:08:05,447 --> 00:08:06,887
assault, and bribery.

164
00:08:07,648 --> 00:08:08,648
Also,

165
00:08:09,208 --> 00:08:10,848
his ex-girlfriend, An Ruoxi,

166
00:08:11,048 --> 00:08:12,487
was killed by his own hand.

167
00:08:12,687 --> 00:08:14,687
A man like that is dangerous.

168
00:08:14,687 --> 00:08:16,648
Which inmate in Sea Breeze
isn't dangerous?

169
00:08:16,807 --> 00:08:18,768
Tu Jiasheng crossed the Nie family.

170
00:08:19,327 --> 00:08:21,288
Anyone who gets too close to him

171
00:08:22,247 --> 00:08:24,408
is crossing the Nie family.

172
00:08:24,807 --> 00:08:26,807
Once he's here,
he's an inmate under my watch.

173
00:08:27,567 --> 00:08:29,768
I only care about
what he does in Sea Breeze.

174
00:08:35,327 --> 00:08:36,327
Boss.

175
00:08:40,088 --> 00:08:42,768
The Warden is stalling Xia Yuyan.
Make it quick.

176
00:08:42,768 --> 00:08:43,807
He's in the shower room.

177
00:08:44,607 --> 00:08:45,607
The perfect time to strike.

178
00:08:45,768 --> 00:08:46,888
Make sure it's clean.

179
00:08:47,488 --> 00:08:48,488
Got it.

180
00:10:23,087 --> 00:10:24,087
Over here, all of you.

181
00:10:24,488 --> 00:10:26,028
Listen up. Injure him,

182
00:10:26,028 --> 00:10:27,368
two cartons and two bottles.

183
00:10:27,368 --> 00:10:29,847
- Kill him, four cartons!
- Get him!

184
00:10:29,847 --> 00:10:30,847
- Get him!
- Get him!

185
00:10:45,207 --> 00:10:46,207
Boss.

186
00:11:15,193 --> 00:11:18,809
♪Streetlights stretch shadows long♪

187
00:11:19,179 --> 00:11:23,164
♪As crowds fade,
who lingers on the edge♪

188
00:11:27,920 --> 00:11:31,239
♪Guarding all those unfinished lies♪

189
00:11:31,239 --> 00:11:36,324
♪Wind sweeps through the empty harbor♪

190
00:11:39,913 --> 00:11:46,465
♪Time quietly strips away the madness♪

191
00:11:46,465 --> 00:11:54,886
♪Plunging all passion
into freezing cold♪

192
00:11:54,886 --> 00:11:58,115
♪The feast ends, leaving only emptiness♪

193
00:11:58,115 --> 00:12:01,310
♪The past drifts far away, unstoppable♪

194
00:12:01,310 --> 00:12:04,003
♪If regret is an inescapable wandering♪

195
00:12:04,003 --> 00:12:08,620
♪I swallow the silence, burning alone♪

196
00:12:12,531 --> 00:12:15,020
♪Burning alone♪

197
00:12:20,526 --> 00:12:26,895
♪The glory fades♪
